     "projectId": "cmr5527fq0006wktd6da6wsf1",
     "type": "CONCEPT",
     "text": "This 4 BHK apartment embraces the clients' lifestyle and their vast collection of art, artefacts and books. A customised artwork by an artist friend takes the vantage position in the living room; dark-toned stone cladding on the opposite wall balances it, and the rest of the home is kept deliberately simple and light.",
